  intr_weak_err_ref.pcpp - break step of intr_weak.pcpp:
  alive of a ref, not a weak (SM0409)

  How to check, from repo\bin:
    pcpp res\tests\intr_weak_err_ref.pcpp
    pcpp res\tests\intr_weak_err_ref.pcpp -t x86_64-linux-gnu
  The marked line reports that code; nothing else is reported.
